WEBVTT

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:10.360
I guess it's time to go and try it...

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.890
Your food for the staff.

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:14.730
Knock it off already.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:18.480
I'm not ready to serve
it to the owner yet.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.970
Stop at a good point.

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:25.700
Staying up late is bad
for your complexion.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.290
Right...

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.490
All right, this looks like
a cinch to make.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.980
Was that pot there before?

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:48.260
Sure feels good to
do a nice deed.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.240
It was <i>her</i>...

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.690
Every once in a while she does something
that reminds me she's my mother.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:01.520
What's that?

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:38.860
I totally forgot that <i>her</i>
birthday's coming up.

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:39.460
The People of the Ristorante

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.980
We had a party for her
here last year too.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:44.170
Did you receive an invitation?

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:46.480
Not at all.

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:51.200
It makes sense, though.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:56.230
Since she doesn't want the owner to
know that I'm actually her daughter.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.230
I guess she had no choice but to
invite me this year, though,

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:01.860
because I came to Rome.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.170
That's not the case at all.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:10.060
I'm sure she's delighted to be able
to spend her special day with you.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:12.040
Claudio...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:14.750
Hey.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.780
Is nine o'clock OK for
Gabrielle's reservation?

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:20.720
That'll be fine, thank you.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.530
I should get back.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.910
Don't let anyone see you.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.820
Thank you for preparing
the antipasto for me.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:47.480
Oh, no. Claudio and Luciano
were the ones behind that.

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:49.110
Oh, I see.

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:50.340
Ciao.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.640
We'll be awaiting your next visit.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:07.190
<i>She shouldn't even come
to the restaurant.</i>

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:10.050
<i>It's just going to annoy Claudio.</i>

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.370
Be more gentle with
the ingredients!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:17.350
There are seven parties
booked for tonight.

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:19.170
One of them is a group from Japan, so...

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:22.360
<i>Claudio said he didn't feel
that way anymore, but...</i>

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:25.370
That ring barely stays on.

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:28.010
Sure you haven't lost
weight, Claudio?

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:31.470
My fingers have gotten narrower.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.840
Why not just take the ring off?

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:36.990
We've been through
this before, Vito.

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:39.260
It's because he can't forget
those memories.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:41.380
That's not why...

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.060
Then what's the problem?

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:45.180
See, it's déjà vu.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.730
<i>It's not that he can't forget,</i>

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.030
<i>it's that he doesn't want
to forget, no?</i>

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:04.740
Claudio!

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:15.150
Don't do that like it's nothing!

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:17.580
Nicoletta!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.490
Still, they sure are late...

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.220
May I interrupt?

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.260
Nicoletta!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:34.850
Have a seat.

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.960
This is your dress for the party.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.720
I just finished buying it for you.

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.320
Don't you have work?

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.110
I took the day off.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:47.020
I'll get you something to drink.

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:52.040
One cappuccino, please.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:54.950
Should I give you two a
few minutes to talk?

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.820
I have to talk to you.

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:00.330
I thought that might
be the case.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.870
Here you go, Nicoletta.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:06.050
I think you know how
Claudio feels.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:10.790
That's all in the past. There's
nothing to discuss now.

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:15.160
Maybe for you, but
not for Claudio.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:18.880
And don't tell me
you haven't noticed.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:23.720
Going to the restaurant all the time, even when
you know how he feels, is downright cruel!

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:33.520
You're absolutely right.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:35.590
I apologize.

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:37.290
Apologize to him.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:39.490
OK.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:43.180
But,

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:45.580
can I still come by
once in a while?

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:50.640
The food is just so good!

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:59.840
Everyone knows Nicoletta
has a crush on Claudio.

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:02.820
I feel bad for her.

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.990
Think about Claudio's feelings, too.

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:06.610
Excuse me, guys...

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:07.660
Sorry.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.160
It's all right.

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:10.430
Though,

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:13.090
you really should take
the ring off.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:19.110
I'm starting to hate
myself for this.

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:21.370
Luciano is so blunt.

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:26.250
Claudio! Gabrielle's
on the phone.

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:31.270
I'm going to take a break from
the restaurant for a while.

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:32.930
Did something happen?

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.770
Want to meet and talk about it?

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:37.680
No, let's not.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.800
That red-headed girl
stopped by earlier.

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:42.250
Nicoletta?

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:46.770
She said it to me...

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:52.280
That it's cruel for me to go to the restaurant
when I know how you feel.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.770
Sorry.

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:58.290
It's fine.

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:01.830
She's a good girl.

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:05.750
She really cares about you.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:14.210
What's so wrong with making
Claudio some pasta?

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:16.590
Anyway, come try
this dress on!

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:19.330
What's that pot all about?

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:23.370
Nothing, really. I was just
in a cooking mood.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.230
Claudio seemed
to really like it.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:26.100
What?

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:29.140
He keeps a close eye on you.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:33.980
I think he was impressed at how you
approached Gabrielle earlier.

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:38.680
That's my girl.

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:43.070
To think you grew up so well even
with me not being around.

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:45.070
I really owe it to your grandmother.

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:47.760
You're the worst.

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:54.300
Yeah, it's almost spring
here in Rome.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.640
Is it still cold there, Grandma?

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.410
Yeah. But forget that,

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:04.200
I heard about Olga's birthday party
coming up. You're going, huh?

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:08.290
It's so random. She's never
invited me before.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:11.000
Just forgive her and let it go.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:14.000
She thought of you
in her own way.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.480
She did?

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:23.730
Every year she'd send me a letter saying
how sorry she was for not inviting you.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.970
What are you going to
get her, Luciano?

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:31.540
You're gonna ask that and not say
what you're getting her yourself?

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:37.020
Have a cup of coffee, Claudio.

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:38.550
Oh, thank you.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:40.520
What's that?

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.060
A list of those invited
to the party.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.520
You're going to be purely
a guest tonight.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:49.030
No way! I'm going to
be in the kitchen.

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:54.490
The Madam will be happier to see
you attending as her daughter.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.430
A daughter of a close
friend, remember?

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:58.480
Why does Claudio know that?

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:04.200
You aren't wearing the dress
I picked out for you...

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.870
But I'm a staff member...

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.380
All the men are going to be
wearing suits tonight,

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.390
so I think it's OK if you
wear a formal dress.

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:13.760
Wearing a dress in the kitchen?

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.750
Teo's not gonna like that.

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:19.420
No problem. You'll
take the day off!

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:22.830
It's a cozy party only for close
friends and family.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:26.000
Then, she'll be coming too, huh?

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.000
Hmm?

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.820
Gabrielle.

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.520
Doubtful.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:42.030
I peeked at the menu before,
and it looks fantastic.

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.520
Go tell her she should come.

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:46.070
She's your good friend, right?

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:49.690
Ah, Nicoletta...

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:55.640
She's a good girl, isn't she?

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:57.070
Indeed.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:02.340
Let's have a big party here
for her birthday too.

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:07.090
I'm always so busy
in November...

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:12.100
I've only ever been able to
send a present and a card.

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:15.440
I'm glad she could
be here tonight.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:19.930
Though, it'd be bad if others found
out that she's my daughter.

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:23.770
What is it?

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:25.560
Your ring looks like it's
going to come off.

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:29.910
You should wear a different ring, if it's
just to keep the customers at bay.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:31.670
I'll get one for you.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:34.410
All right...

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:39.000
You make it so easy to take
advantage of you, Claudio.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.390
Well...

00:11:40.390 --> 00:11:41.740
But you know, Claudio...

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:42.380
Yes?

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:48.030
Gabrielle isn't the only one waiting
for you to take that ring off.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:55.350
Is my hair going to be
OK all flat like this?

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.610
Oh, whatever.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.020
The pot!

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:07.860
It's like she just cooked
it for herself.

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:14.880
Actually, can she even cook?

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:18.890
I can't picture her acting
like a housewife...

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:27.800
I guess it's fine.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:56.740
You look concerned about me.

00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:57.990
I'm not...

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:00.710
I won't say anything.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:07.520
I'll the keep the fact I'm
your daughter a secret.

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:11.300
Happy birthday.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.370
The food is a hit!

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:19.970
Isn't it fantastic? Gigi's eating
his fill tonight, even.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:23.200
And we've got extra help
tonight, as well.

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:27.390
Oh no, I'm honored to be standing in
the same kitchen as Mr. Facchini.

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:30.710
As you're a guest tonight, you
are not to enter the kitchen.

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.870
You don't have to block me...

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:36.110
He's blushing because you look
so fetching tonight, Nicoletta.

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:37.720
What?

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:39.910
You're always quick
with the jokes!

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:43.720
But she truly is fetching.
Don't you agree, Claudio?

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.140
Absolutely.

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:51.330
Teo, it's about time we bring
her dish to the guests.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.300
Carry it out, Nicoletta.

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:56.810
What? I-I shouldn't...

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:59.460
What? You're so modest
all of a sudden.

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:02.060
And here I was trying to pay
you your rightful dues.

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:03.180
Huh?

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.890
This is the best meal
you've made so far.

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:10.680
You did a proper job and
put feeling into it.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:13.160
Show some more confidence.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.260
Guys...

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:27.400
Shouldn't you ask someone
else to do it today?

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:31.360
Is she really my daughter?

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:33.390
She's got it together so well.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:36.600
Sure it's not because
you didn't raise her?

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.650
Seriously.

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:42.290
I've got to be one of the
worst mothers alive.

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:44.290
You <i>were</i> one.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:48.260
But now, she's close by and
really looks to you.

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:52.500
A girl moving on from her
mother is a huge deal.

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:56.850
She's going to become a charming lady right
by your side now, don't you think?

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:04.320
Tanti auguri a te.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:07.820
Tanti auguri a te.

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:07.270
Lorenzo?

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:12.290
Tanti auguri a Olga...

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:16.400
Tanti auguri a te.

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:17.260
My, it looks delicious!

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:21.810
Nicoletta made this cake for
you. She said it's a gift.

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.190
I have a confession to make.

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:54.490
My daughter, Nicoletta, made
this cake for me as a gift!

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:55.230
What?

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:02.060
I had her with my ex-husband.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.380
I apologize for keeping
it secret all this time.

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:06.890
I didn't want to be rejected,

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:09.100
so I just kept on lying...

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.810
I'm so sorry.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:16.120
Oh, I knew.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.360
What?

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:21.920
I knew she was your daughter soon
after she started working here.

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.840
You have the same smile.

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:26.890
I wondered why you
never said anything.

00:16:26.890 --> 00:16:30.700
But, Lorenzo, you said you don't
like women with kids...

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:34.000
Sure, I'd have preferred that.

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:39.270
But, I'll welcome her with open
arms, if she's your daughter.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:52.280
I'm so sorry, Nicoletta.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:57.850
It's fine.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:01.010
I just get to be a selfish
brat for a while.

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:05.110
Anyway, blow out the candles!

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:07.750
Right...

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:45.510
Oh, I'll carry those.

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:46.990
Don't worry about it.

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:51.910
All right...

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:55.800
That was anticlimactic.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:59.360
I didn't think the owner was
the type to reject her,

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:01.340
and turns out I was right.

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:06.540
But, I also understand what it's like to be a woman
frantically in love and afraid of rejection.

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:11.650
I don't want to be
rejected either.

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:14.650
You're in luck, then.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:24.690
I'm so happy.

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:49.430
Olga really seems like she's
made up for lost time.

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:52.460
It's like revealing her daughter
has given her new life.

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:54.280
How are things at the restaurant?

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.740
She's continuing on
as an apprentice.

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:59.240
Luciano still scolds her.

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:03.250
So, what did you want
to see me about?

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:17.590
Sorry it took so long.

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:22.470
Have you responded to
her feelings for you?

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.400
No, not yet.

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:25.460
Hmm?

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:28.220
We're still...

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:32.500
Come by the restaurant sometime.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:46.960
All right, here's a little extra.

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:48.420
Thank you.

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:51.290
Oh, Claudio!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.340
Your father?

00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:54.730
No way, my boyfriend.

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:56.060
Oh...

00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:57.040
Nicoletta!

00:19:57.040 --> 00:20:00.030
Sorry, she misspoke...

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:01.790
Are you out shopping
too, Claudio?

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:05.570
Yes. I'll carry your bags.

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:07.260
Thank you.

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:11.510
Anything else you want to check out?

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.800
Claudio...

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:16.980
Are you free today?

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:20.910
I usually relax at home
on my days off.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:22.440
Wanna come over?

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:23.870
I'll make you something
good to eat.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:24.800
But...

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:28.800
All right. Carry those bags
to my apartment.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:40.510
I wonder if the regulars will be
able to tell we're an item.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.630
<i>I feel like I won somehow.</i>

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:52.810
OK, smile.

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:01.900
<i>Its name is casetta dell'orso.</i>

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:07.210
<i>If you ever find yourself in
Rome, go look for it...</i>
